<title>INDIA: India RBI bans CRB Capital from accepting deposits.</title>
<headline>India RBI bans CRB Capital from accepting deposits.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it prohibited private finance company CRB Capital Markets Ltd from accepting deposits.</p>
<p>An RBI statement on Wednesday night did not give any reasons for the ban.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
